WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.240
You're abroad, and a market stall offers
you a fruit you have never seen before.

2
00:00:05.290 --> 00:00:08.710
For many Muslims, what
they eat really matters.

3
00:00:08.760 --> 00:00:13.790
Food, drink, clothes and even
money can be halal or haram.

4
00:00:13.840 --> 00:00:17.120
The Qur'an names a short list
of foods that are forbidden.

5
00:00:17.170 --> 00:00:19.630
But no verse names this fruit.

6
00:00:19.680 --> 00:00:22.460
So, is a Muslim allowed to eat it?

7
00:00:22.510 --> 00:00:26.040
In this mission, you'll see
where Muslim rules come from:

8
00:00:26.090 --> 00:00:29.520
the Qur'an, the Prophet's
example and scholars.

9
00:00:29.570 --> 00:00:34.970
Then you'll weigh up how Muslims read one
verse on modest dress in different ways.

10
00:00:35.020 --> 00:00:40.200
Your mission: decide whether a Muslim
may eat a fruit that no verse mentions.
